---
export const prerender = true;

import PageHeader from '../components/ui/PageHeader.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Omar Mo, a software engineer helping small teams use AI in practical ways.">
	<PageHeader title="About" />
	<div class="prose-site">
		<p>
			I'm a self-taught software engineer. I've spent the last few years building developer tools and web products used
			across the web.
		</p>
		<p>
			These days most of my attention is on AI: what it's good at, where it falls over, and how small teams can use it
			without a big budget. I wrote about how I think about it in
			<a href="/posts/solve-problems/"><em>Don't write code. Solve problems.</em></a>
		</p>
		<p>Outside work I read a lot of historical fiction and play more RPGs than I should.</p>
	</div>
</Base>
